// The default resource pack (#1860): the game's own resources, in the manifest format a player's
// pack shares (#1858). Every lookup goes through ResourcePacks, which walks the loaded packs in
// order, this one last. Its files are named from this folder, its root: its textures, models and sounds
// load as Godot imported them, its region files, pieces, realms, quests, species, tile blueprints, loot
// tables, materials and tonics are read as text, and its translation catalogues load as gettext .po files.
